[en.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_CENTER]
Canterlot Economic Center

[en.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_CENTER_desc]
Through trade and factory production, Canterlot is expected to be rebuilt as one of the economic centers of Equestria.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_CENTER]
坎特洛特经济中心

[zh.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_CENTER_desc]
通过贸易和工厂生产，将坎特洛特重新打造成小马利亚中央大陆的经济中心之一。

